; Silence DEP0205 emitted by tsx 4.21's `module.register()` call. tsx is the
; latest published version (no upstream fix yet) and we cannot drop tsx —
; native `node --strip-types` is rejected for this codebase (relative imports
; with `.js` extensions; see Node 26 conventions in CLAUDE.md). Targets the
; specific code only; other deprecations stay loud.
node-options=--disable-warning=DEP0205
